    "distance_km": 10.0,
    "description": "This walk takes you through Glen Ample in the Loch Lomond and the Trossachs National Park. The scenic trail takes you from Loch Earn to Loch Lubnaig passing along the pretty Burn of Ample. The walk starts just south of Loch Earn at the picturesque old bridge at the Falls of Edinample. From here you follow the trails south along the burn passing the fords, waterfalls and forestry of the glen.",
